  "reflectionText": "The Lord asked Ezekiel: can these bones live? Ezekiel prophesied, and the bones came together, bone to bone, sinews and flesh and skin. He prophesied to the wind, and the breath came in. They stood up an exceedingly great army. What is it to be asked to speak life into the place where you can see only dry bones?"
